  "knowledge_information": "All sorted unique allowed original mechanism_of_action strings only; no extra target names/IDs, synonyms, disease/approval fields or response selection.",
  "target_geometry": "Binary membership of deduplicated linked human ChEMBL target IDs; set Jaccard. Target objects may be complexes, families, proteins or nucleic acids; not a gene network. Missing/empty sets fail, never zero vectors.",
  "morgan_geometry": "Pure binary Tanimoto on frozen full-source radius2 2048bit chirality-preserving Morgan; no dose/state kernel added because dose/context fixed.",
  "truth_geometry": "Float64 cosine of original effect_log2fc on unchanged heldout-line source-A-selected 3000-gene panel. No centering/residualization or gene re-selection. Fail closed on any exact zero norm.",
  "original_complete_geometry": "Slice archived authenticated E02 complete_metadata strict-upper cosines bitwise; do not refit or recompute original encoder geometry.",
