  "neighbor_k": 10,
  "minimum_group_n": 12,
  "truth_relevance": "Exclude self. Fractional top10 boundary exact ties sum10; all truth candidates tied -> NA; recompute per fixed cohort.",
  "predicted_ties": "Expected DCG over uniform exact-score tie permutations; all predicted candidates tied -> analytic random NDCG and exact zero excess; no tolerance or ID tiebreak.",
  "rsa": "Spearman on strict upper triangle, average exact-tie ranks; constant geometry NA. No pair-level inference.",
  "fusion": "Within each already-filtered cohort/line/dose strict-upper pair list, ascending doubled midranks r2. F=(r2_a+r2_b-4)/(4*(P-1)); one final division; fixed0.5 weights. Constant component percentile0.5. Mirror symmetric; exclude diagonal from every rank and score.",
  "paired": "Left minus right within same cohort and group; compute query differences only for shared finite endpoints before aggregation; retain both marginal and paired counts. RSA paired on common valid groups.",
